{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38555","headline":"岐下寓居见槐花落因寄从事 · 吴融","name":"岐下寓居见槐花落因寄从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才开便落不胜黄，覆着庭莎衬夕阳。\n只共蝉催双鬓老，可知人已十年忙。\n晓窗须爲吟秋兴，夜枕应教梦帝乡。\n蜀国马卿看从猎，肯将闲事入凄凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}